### Fetch settings
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/settings

### Fetch data
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/data?fromDate=2000-01-01&toDate=2999-12-31

### Generate CSV export
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/generate-csv?fromDate=2000-01-01&toDate=2999-12-31

### Fetch school starter package report data
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/school-starter-package?ageMin=6&ageMax=10

### Generate school starter package report CSV export
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/generate-school-starter-package-csv?ageMin=6&ageMax=10
